  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A block of mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"12\"></span> kg, initially at rest, experiences a horizontal applied force and moves through a horizontal distance of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"100\"></span> m. A constant frictional force of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"6.0\"></span> N also acts on the block, opposing the motion of the block. The graph shows how the applied force varies with the distance travelled by the block. </p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>What is the speed of the block after it has travelled <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"100\"></span> m?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4.0\"></span> m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"6.0\"></span> m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"8.0\"></span> m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"10\"></span> m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
  },
